WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:15.834
Izzie was having a bad day.

2
00:00:15.835 --> 00:00:19.067
Normally she loved gym.

3
00:00:19.068 --> 00:00:23.540
But today she didn't even feel like playing kickball.

4
00:00:23.541 --> 00:00:28.229
And normally she loved it when her teacher read aloud to them.

5
00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:38.060
But today she kept wondering when the book would be over.

6
00:00:38.061 --> 00:00:43.336
"Izzie! We're making chocolate chip cookies today!" Nina shouted.

7
00:00:43.337 --> 00:00:48.276
Izzie smiled. "I love cookies," she said.

8
00:00:48.277 --> 00:00:53.247
Maybe chocolate chip cookies would turn her bad day into a good day.

9
00:00:53.248 --> 00:00:56.191
"Me too," Miss Shelly said.

10
00:00:56.192 --> 00:01:00.226
"Nothing beats warm, homemade cookies.

11
00:01:00.227 --> 00:01:03.434
Put on your aprons and get ready to bake!"

12
00:01:03.435 --> 00:01:06.329
The ingredients were ready on the table.

13
00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:13.144
"Step 1: Mix one cup brown sugar and half a cup white sugar," Jason read.

14
00:01:13.145 --> 00:01:18.761
"Step 2: Add chopped butter and mix well," Ethan said.

15
00:01:18.762 --> 00:01:22.244
He stirred the sugar and butter together.

16
00:01:22.245 --> 00:01:27.947
"Step 3: Add two eggs," Izzie said, cracking an egg.

17
00:01:27.948 --> 00:01:33.722
"Step 4: Add one teaspoon of vanilla," Bobby said.

18
00:01:33.723 --> 00:01:38.647
"And stir, stir, stir!" Nina reminded Ethan.

19
00:01:38.648 --> 00:01:42.357
"Now mix the dry ingredients in a different bowl.

20
00:01:42.358 --> 00:01:48.570
Then we'll add them into the wet ingredients little by little," Miss Shelly said.

21
00:01:48.571 --> 00:01:57.859
"Two and a quarter cups of flour," Bobby read.

22
00:01:57.860 --> 00:02:01.986
"One teaspoon baking soda," Jason said.

23
00:02:01.987 --> 00:02:05.424
"One teaspoon salt," Nina said.

24
00:02:05.425 --> 00:02:07.463
"And chocolate chips!"

25
00:02:07.464 --> 00:02:10.504
Izzie reached for the bag of chocolate chips.

26
00:02:10.505 --> 00:02:13.955
Suddenly she felt dizzy.

27
00:02:13.956 --> 00:02:17.740
She sat down and realized she had a headache.

28
00:02:17.741 --> 00:02:22.216
"Miss Shelly? My head hurts," Izzie said.

29
00:02:22.217 --> 00:02:26.521
"Oh no." Miss Shelly sounded concerned.

30
00:02:26.522 --> 00:02:30.449
"Nina, set up some mats for Izzie to lie down on.

31
00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:33.550
Boys, mix in the dry ingredients."

32
00:02:33.551 --> 00:02:38.577
Nina went to the closet and pulled out some gym mats.

33
00:02:38.578 --> 00:02:40.910
The boys were ready to bake.

34
00:02:40.911 --> 00:02:44.525
"Drop spoonfuls of cookie dough on the baking tray.

35
00:02:44.526 --> 00:02:48.489
Oh! Did someone remember to preheat the toaster oven?"

36
00:02:48.490 --> 00:02:50.866
Miss Shelly suddenly asked.

37
00:02:50.867 --> 00:02:54.113
"I did." Jason grinned.

38
00:02:54.114 --> 00:03:00.213
"Thanks." Miss Shelly looked relieved.

39
00:03:00.214 --> 00:03:05.296
"I hope Izzie feels better by the time the cookies are done," she said.

40
00:03:05.297 --> 00:03:08.096
Then Nina came back to the table.

41
00:03:08.097 --> 00:03:11.999
"Is she all right?" Miss Shelly asked quietly.

42
00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.606
Nina nodded. "She's lying down.

43
00:03:15.607 --> 00:03:18.911
I think she fell asleep already!"

44
00:03:18.912 --> 00:03:24.105
"Bake for ten minutes at 190 degrees," Bobby read.

45
00:03:24.106 --> 00:03:26.381
"Right, Miss Shelly?"

46
00:03:26.382 --> 00:03:29.306
"Yes! 190 degrees.

47
00:03:29.307 --> 00:03:36.763
Ten minutes," Miss Shelly said.

48
00:03:36.764 --> 00:03:39.455
She let out a sigh.

49
00:03:39.456 --> 00:03:43.600
"Let's clean up, everyone."

50
00:03:43.601 --> 00:03:47.205
"They smell good," Bobby said.

51
00:03:47.206 --> 00:03:49.107
"Can I eat one?"

52
00:03:49.108 --> 00:03:52.765
"We have to let them cool first," Jason said.

53
00:03:52.766 --> 00:03:56.180
"Put them on the cooling rack," Miss Shelly said.

54
00:03:56.181 --> 00:04:01.711
"Miss Shelly, maybe Izzie would like a cookie," Nina said.

55
00:04:01.712 --> 00:04:07.532
"You're right. Why don't you go wake her up and ask?" Miss Shelly said.

56
00:04:07.533 --> 00:04:09.206
"We'll all go!

57
00:04:09.207 --> 00:04:12.561
And we'll bring her some cookies," Ethan said.

58
00:04:12.562 --> 00:04:17.861
"Hey, Izzie. Are you feeling better?" Nina asked.

59
00:04:17.862 --> 00:04:21.562
Izzie sat up and yawned.

60
00:04:21.563 --> 00:04:24.685
"Yeah. I think I just needed a nap."

61
00:04:24.686 --> 00:04:27.774
"We brought you cookies," Jason said.

62
00:04:27.775 --> 00:04:31.066
"Thanks! Sorry I didn't help more."

63
00:04:31.067 --> 00:04:33.342
Izzie bit into a cookie.

64
00:04:33.343 --> 00:04:38.066
"Mmm! Good job, bakers!" She smiled.

65
00:04:38.067 --> 00:04:43.563
Her bad day was finally over.

66
00:04:43.564 --> 00:05:01.145
[caption_out@
